        "original_id": "ee372791-ad7d-53a4-89d0-f6dd03ec6861",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Grown Ups, Grown Ups 2, Tommy Boy, Black Sheep, Joe Dirt, Saturday Night Live\n- People: Dennis Dugan, Adam Sandler, Kevin James, Chris Rock, David Spade, Rob Schneider, Joyce Van Patten, Talia Balsam, Martin Balsam\n- Concepts: film plot, acting careers, family relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Grown Ups is a 2010 American comedy film directed by Dennis Dugan.\n- Grown Ups stars Adam Sandler, Kevin James, Chris Rock, David Spade, and Rob Schneider.\n- Grown Ups depicts five friends from a high school basketball team reuniting for a holiday weekend after learning that their coach has died.\n- David Spade rose to fame in the 1990s as a cast member on Saturday Night Live.\n- David Spade later had a successful acting career in film and television.\n- David Spade starred or co-starred in Tommy Boy, Black Sheep, Joe Dirt, Grown Ups, and Grown Ups 2.\n- Joyce Van Patten is recognized for playing the wise elderly wife of Rob Schneider's character in the 2010 Adam Sandler comedy Grown Ups.\n- Talia Balsam is the daughter of film actor Martin Balsam and actress Joyce Van Patten.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
